    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***VICTORIAN RED BRICK / 5 BED 3 BATH FAMILY HOME /  EXCELLENT LOCATION /  REAR ACCESS / OFF STREET PARKING / EXTENDED***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present 93 Sandford Road to the open market. This handsome Victorian red-brick residence enjoys a prime position on the highly sought-after Sandford Road and is within easy walking distance of Ranelagh Village and its wide array of amenities. \r\n\r\nThe area is renowned for its elegant period homes, generous proportions, and timeless character. Extending to approximately 188 sq.m, 93 Sandford Road is elegantly proportioned throughout and full of natural light. It retains many original features and, furthermore, boasts an extension to the rear which provides valuable vehicular access/parking.\r\n\r\nThe charming hallway of this property is accessed via a classic Victorian front door with covered porch and leads into the first of two fine reception rooms. This room features typically high ceilings and a stunning bay window providing wonderful natural light. The second reception room is similarly elegant and generously proportioned.\r\n\r\nThe hallway continues through to the sizeable kitchen with dining area. This kitchen boasts two windows and a glass-panelled door leads to the rear of the property and off-street parking. There is a bank of kitchen units providing ample storage. A guest WC completes the accommodation on this floor.\r\n\r\nOn the first-floor return there is a bathroom with both electric shower and bath. The second floor boasts two large bedrooms, the one to the front enhanced by another glorious bay window. On the second-floor return there is another bathroom with shower. There are three further bedrooms on the third floor as well as a large hot press.\r\n\r\nThis property is wonderfully positioned beside Ranelagh and Donnybrook villages with nearby selection of shops, restaurants, cafes, bus routes, LUAS and a host of schools including Sandford National, Ranelagh Multi-denominational, Scoil Bhride, Sandford Park, Gonzaga, Muckross Park, Alexandra College etc. There are numerous sports facilities in the area including David Lloyd Dublin Riverview, Mount Pleasant and Fitzwilliam Tennis Clubs. The beautiful Herbert Park is within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
